-- statement:
--   For every finite horizon truncation, the original-process discounted dividend Stieltjes cash, including continuous and singular payments and time-zero right-payment, plus surviving terminal reward is integrable and pathwise bounded by w(x) plus the centered finite-activity marked-jump term J-V.
